<title>USA: Olympus Ventures names new CEO.</title>
<headline>Olympus Ventures names new CEO.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Olympus Ventures Inc said on Wednesday it named Gary Russell Morgan chief executive.</p>
<p>Morgan is the founder of Horizons International Associates Inc and a former chief executive of National Properties Pty Ltd, which is listed on the Johannesburg stock exchange.</p>
<p>Olympus owns and operates knitting, cutting, sewing mills and finishing factories.</p>
